 data-start="1193" data-end="1225">What to Expect on Your Ride</h2><p data-start="1227" data-end="1472">After a quick safety orientation, you’re free to cruise open water, carve through smooth Gulf swells, or follow scenic coastal routes. Spot dolphins, explore sandbars, and experience St. Petersburg from the water — the way it’s meant to be seen.</p><p data-start="1474" data-end="1544">Perfect for couples, families, first-timers, and thrill-seekers alike.</p><hr data-start="1546" data-end="1549" /><h2 data-start="1551" data-end="1571">Before You Book</h2><ul data-start="1573" data-end="1817"><li data-start="1573" data-end="1599"><p data-start="1575" data-end="1599">Minimum driver age: 18</p></li><li data-start="1600" data-end="1663"><p data-start="1602" data-end="1663">Boater safety course required if born after January 1, 1988</p></li><li data-start="1664" data-end="1703"><p data-start="1666" data-end="1703">Valid government-issued ID required ( Photo Passport also Valid for International guests)</p></li><li data-start="1704" data-end="1741"><p data-start="1706" data-end="1741">Please arrive 20–30 minutes early</p></li><li data-start="1742" data-end="1817"><p data-start="1744" data-end="1817">Weather policy: Full refund or easy reschedule if conditions are unsafe</p></li></ul><hr data-start="1819" data-end="1822" /><h2 data-start="1824" data-end="1871">⚠️ Limited Availability During Peak Season</h2><p data-start="1873" data-end="1962">Weekend, holiday, and spring break time slots sell out quickly — especially midday rides.</p><p data-start="1964" data-end="2078">If your preferred time is available right now, we recommend securing it immediately. Once a slot fills, it’s gone.</p><hr data-start="2080" data-end="2083" /><h3 data-start="2085" data-end="2103">Ready to Ride?</h3><p data-start="2105" data-end="2190">Check real-time availability below and lock in your jet ski rental before spots fill.</p>","__globals__":{"text_color":""},"text_color":"#FFFFFF"},"elements"